WEBVTT

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:19.320
A light so bright that it can't be hidden
Breaks the silence and resurrects in this world

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:30.070
The dry land quakes violently
Sparks clash as we risk our lives

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:37.790
Let a miracle occur, just one more time

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:44.950
The power to regain the pages of memories I lost long ago

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:53.020
The trusting heart pierces the darkness
Search for the place where the soul rests

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:59.250
The sharp glint in my unblinking eye burns

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:06.700
Two souls - light and shadow
To the future shown in the crystal

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:13.310
Now moving  Overflowing in red  eyes

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:37.080
By gaining the spirits' power, Bakura has the advantage in his battle against the priests.

00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:41.360
Karim fell, and we thought it was over for us.

00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:47.400
But my father Aknamkanon’s spirit led the spirits to the afterlife.

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:48.860
Now, Mahad!

00:01:48.860 --> 00:01:51.060
Finish Diabound!

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:54.360
It's over, Bakura!

00:01:54.360 --> 00:02:00.360
A New Stage

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:10.460
We're back here.

00:02:10.460 --> 00:02:17.080
Any clues to finding my other self's name must be inside the palace.

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:24.160
My other self can't win this game unless we find his name.

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:31.840
I now know we came to this world to find your forgotten name.

00:02:31.840 --> 00:02:38.120
So please let us into the palace, my other self.

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:44.080
We can enter!

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:46.700
Really?

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:51.560
There’s a lot of food in the palace!

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:54.380
Bobasa will eat a lot!

00:02:54.380 --> 00:02:57.580
Let’s go find my other self's name!

00:02:57.900 --> 00:02:58.820
Yeah!

00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:00.820
Yugi, wait up!

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:01.440
Yugi!

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:03.200
Bobasa’s going too!

00:03:11.860 --> 00:03:14.840
This palace is incredible!

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:18.620
But since it's so huge, I don’t know where to start looking.

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:21.620
Let's split up and search.

00:03:21.620 --> 00:03:22.680
Right!

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:30.620
Yugi!

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:34.360
Just wait!  I’ll kill you all!

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:39.660
And take your Millennium Items and gain the powers of darkness!

00:03:49.520 --> 00:03:51.360
Damn!

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:53.360
It's pointless, Bakura.

00:03:53.360 --> 00:04:00.360
As long as we have the remaining Millennium Items, Zorc’s seal won't be broken.

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:03.340
Be quiet!

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:10.820
Give up, Bakura.  You lost.

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:13.240
Are you sure?

00:04:14.180 --> 00:04:15.660
Aknadin?

00:04:18.140 --> 00:04:23.740
Everything needed for the resurrection ritual is here.

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:24.840
What?

00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:29.760
That’s...

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:32.260
That’s Shada’s Millennium Key!

00:04:32.260 --> 00:04:35.260
What’s going on, Aknadin?

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:38.640
The time has finally come.

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:52.120
Where am I?

00:04:52.120 --> 00:04:54.620
Why are you here?

00:04:56.240 --> 00:04:57.980
What’s happening?

00:04:58.940 --> 00:04:59.960
What?

00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:03.760
I don't need you anymore.

00:05:04.340 --> 00:05:05.740
That voice...

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:09.920
What’s going on?  Help me!

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:11.220
Help-

00:05:16.280 --> 00:05:21.220
According to the rules, pieces that are no longer needed vanish, Yugi.

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:22.720
Pieces?

00:05:23.280 --> 00:05:25.760
Aknadin...

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:29.710
Shada!

00:05:33.420 --> 00:05:37.450
Where's the Pharaoh's name?

00:05:37.450 --> 00:05:44.320
Even if his name was written here, I can’t read it.

00:05:50.060 --> 00:05:53.840
Quick question: Do you know the Pharaoh’s-

00:05:55.800 --> 00:06:01.180
Oh yeah.  We’re ghosts in this world.

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:08.960
I definitely think it's here.

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:12.440
But I can’t touch any of the books.

00:06:13.900 --> 00:06:16.200
How are we supposed to find it?

00:06:18.820 --> 00:06:21.840
Bobasa prefers to eat than search.

00:06:21.840 --> 00:06:23.820
Delicious!

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:25.020
Bobasa-

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:32.560
Where's the eighth key?  Where's the Pharaoh’s name?

00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:33.760
Shada!

00:06:33.770 --> 00:06:37.780
Akanadin, that’s my Millennium Key!

00:06:37.780 --> 00:06:40.140
Please give it back, Aknadin!

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:43.060
Let go of me!

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:44.640
Shada!

00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:46.640
Can’t you just die!

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:49.720
Aknadin!  Why did you do that?

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:51.140
Have you gone insane?

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:53.660
What’s going on, Aknadin?

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:55.180
Explain yourself!

00:06:55.860 --> 00:06:57.680
So arrogant.

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:59.440
Aknadin!

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:04.680
You can't speak to the Pharaoh like that, Aknadin!

00:07:04.680 --> 00:07:06.040
Silence!

00:07:07.180 --> 00:07:08.960
What’s wrong, Seto?

00:07:13.420 --> 00:07:15.920
I told you that the time has come.

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:20.640
My body...

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:24.380
You can’t move, Pharaoh.

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:27.280
What did you do, Aknadin?

00:07:29.940 --> 00:07:35.980
Due to the power of Zorc, the Conqueror of Time, I was able to stop time!

00:07:35.980 --> 00:07:42.280
Only I am allowed to move.

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:46.800
You’re a novice who doesn’t deserve to be the Pharaoh!

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:49.860
Millennium Rod!

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:52.740
Millennium Necklace!

00:07:53.260 --> 00:07:57.440
And the final one is right here!

00:07:59.360 --> 00:08:01.400
Aknadin!

00:08:02.420 --> 00:08:03.460
Stop it!

00:08:04.860 --> 00:08:08.960
Now all the Millennium Items are here!

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:14.200
Aknadin, place all the Millennium Items in the stone tablet.

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:19.200
Why?  Bakura died, so why hasn’t the Shadow Game ended?

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:24.720
And why can I still hear Bakura’s voice when he turned into sand?

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:33.440
Now's the time for Zorc to resurrect and bring me victory!

00:08:38.380 --> 00:08:42.800
I defeated Bakura, so why am I not the winner?

00:08:42.800 --> 00:08:44.560
Why has time stopped?

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:48.620
How long will this Shadow Game last?

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:50.540
"Game?"

00:08:50.540 --> 00:08:52.440
This is the end.

00:08:55.280 --> 00:08:57.870
I see!  This is...

00:09:05.550 --> 00:09:11.080
You finally realized you’re a Game Master, Yugi.

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:13.570
Bakura!  Where am I?

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:14.720
This place?

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:18.810
You can call it the sanctuary of the gods.

00:09:18.810 --> 00:09:22.500
This is what the ultimate Shadow Game actually looks like.

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:24.320
A Shadow RPG!

00:09:24.320 --> 00:09:26.320
Shadow RPG?

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:30.130
Yes.  The setting is ancient Egypt.

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:37.410
This field recreates the world 3,000 years ago when you were the Pharaoh.

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:40.520
As Game Masters, we control the characters.

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:43.840
Whoever fulfills the victory conditions will win.

00:09:43.840 --> 00:09:46.600
So my character is the Pharaoh.

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:49.860
And yours is Bandit King Bakura.

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:55.090
But by defeating Bakura, I fulfilled the victory conditions!

00:09:55.090 --> 00:09:56.350
So why?

00:09:57.700 --> 00:09:59.840
Too bad, Yugi.

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:04.500
When the seven Millennium Items were placed in the tablet...

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:07.100
...the game entered a new stage.

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:10.090
So the victory conditions changed!

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:13.590
My soul enters the tablet of the afterlife!

00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:17.090
And I resurrect as Zorc!

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:24.720
So if I don’t defeat Zorc, I lose?

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:26.670
You don’t just lose.

00:10:26.670 --> 00:10:27.610
What?

00:10:27.610 --> 00:10:36.290
Your friends who went through the Puzzle's maze to enter the game world and find you?

00:10:36.290 --> 00:10:38.000
They'll all die.

00:10:39.850 --> 00:10:42.090
Yes.  Die.

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:46.860
How dare you, Bakura!

00:11:03.240 --> 00:11:07.950
If you want to save your friends, you have to defeat me.

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:11.690
But your characters can’t move.

00:11:12.340 --> 00:11:14.160
Due to this.

00:11:14.160 --> 00:11:15.310
What’s that?

00:11:15.310 --> 00:11:18.690
My Master Item, Hourglass of Frozen Time.

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:20.700
Master Item?

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:22.010
That’s right.

00:11:22.010 --> 00:11:29.210
When this Item is on the field, only the characters I choose can move.

00:11:29.630 --> 00:11:31.710
Hourglass of Frozen Time...

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:36.020
And I have another Item.

00:11:36.020 --> 00:11:38.730
Remember this, Yugi?

00:11:38.730 --> 00:11:44.720
I used it to reverse time and prevent you from meeting your friends.

00:12:01.940 --> 00:12:03.680
That was you?

00:12:03.680 --> 00:12:09.060
Yes.  I used my Hourglass of Time Reversal.

00:12:09.060 --> 00:12:12.690
Yugi, I'll tell you one last thing.

00:12:12.690 --> 00:12:17.140
I can activate my effects three times.

00:12:17.140 --> 00:12:22.420
In other words, I have one more Master Item.

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:29.460
What’s happening?

00:12:30.300 --> 00:12:33.000
Why can’t I move?

00:12:33.550 --> 00:12:39.860
Did something happen to my other self?

00:12:40.560 --> 00:12:43.060
Damn!  What’s going on?

00:12:45.370 --> 00:12:46.760
What’s going on?

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:50.820
Only the ones I choose can move.

00:12:50.820 --> 00:12:52.750
So why can he move?

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:59.490
No matter how much I eat, I’m still hungry.

00:12:59.490 --> 00:13:04.500
Zorc!  Please hear my wishes!

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:10.000
I sense a huge, terrifying evil.

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:12.340
We can't let it resurrect!

00:13:12.340 --> 00:13:20.270
Priest Aknadin, I knew you'd come here to form a dark contract with me.

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:27.360
Because you're the one responsible for creating the Millennium Items.

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:36.360
Aknadin, if you agree to become my slave, I will grant you your wish.

00:13:37.400 --> 00:13:39.380
I only have one wish.

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:43.610
For my son Seto to become the new Pharaoh!

00:13:43.610 --> 00:13:44.690
What?

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:45.850
Seto?

00:13:45.850 --> 00:13:53.020
Me?  I’m Aknadin’s son?

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:55.950
I heard your wish.

00:13:55.950 --> 00:13:59.620
Take my power, Aknadin!

00:14:04.790 --> 00:14:06.790
Aknadin!

00:14:14.280 --> 00:14:19.270
Aknadin has leveled up by gaining dark spellcaster skills!

00:14:19.270 --> 00:14:21.690
He has become the Great Shadow Magus!

00:14:21.690 --> 00:14:22.770
What?

00:14:22.770 --> 00:14:24.770
Great Shadow Magus?

00:14:24.770 --> 00:14:32.010
You probably don’t remember, but history is being reproduced.

00:14:32.010 --> 00:14:34.780
Other than a few minor details.

00:14:34.780 --> 00:14:39.800
What happened 3,000 years ago is being repeated.

00:14:39.800 --> 00:14:47.300
Back then, when Zorc resurrected, you offered your own life to seal Zorc away.

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:50.100
But that won’t happen this time.

00:14:50.100 --> 00:14:56.030
I'll resurrect Zorc and transform the world into a paradise of destruction and despair!

00:14:56.030 --> 00:15:00.200
Witness my third Master Item!

00:15:01.070 --> 00:15:02.330
That’s...

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:06.890
The seven Millennium Items have been placed in the tablet of the afterlife.

00:15:06.890 --> 00:15:11.620
I activate the third hourglass: The Hourglass of Evil!

00:15:11.620 --> 00:15:12.330
What?

00:15:12.330 --> 00:15:14.560
Hourglass of Evil?

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:22.000
When all the sand in this hourglass falls, Zorc will resurrect!

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:36.320
This is the room with all the Pharaohs' names.

00:15:36.320 --> 00:15:43.330
The name of the current Pharaoh will be next to Aknamkanon's.

00:15:44.180 --> 00:15:45.100
What?

00:15:46.130 --> 00:15:48.060
What's going on?

00:15:48.480 --> 00:15:51.070
The name I need isn't engraved!

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:58.800
Great Shadow Magus, kill the Pharaoh to make your wish come true!

00:16:01.300 --> 00:16:07.810
Aknadin is my father?

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:12.560
On that day, my father never came back.

00:16:13.010 --> 00:16:17.560
That father was Aknadin?

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:20.570
My son Seto, I'll tell you this:

00:16:20.570 --> 00:16:24.560
Pharaoh Aknamkanon was my older brother!

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:25.530
What?

00:16:25.530 --> 00:16:30.060
Aknadin is my father's younger brother?

00:16:31.520 --> 00:16:37.540
That’s something only I and Aknadin knew.

00:16:37.950 --> 00:16:42.160
We made a vow never to reveal that fact.

00:16:43.050 --> 00:16:47.540
Why have you now broken your vow?

00:16:47.540 --> 00:16:54.290
Seto, that's why you also have the right to become the Pharaoh.

00:16:54.290 --> 00:17:00.800
If we get rid of these people from stopping you, you can claim the throne.

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:11.290
I will kill the Pharaoh to make Seto the new Pharaoh of this land!

00:17:24.580 --> 00:17:28.120
Someone is deflecting the attack!

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:32.130
Who's protecting the Pharaoh?

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:39.640
Bakura, you’re not the only one with a Master Item.

00:17:40.220 --> 00:17:41.640
That’s...

00:17:42.460 --> 00:17:44.220
Who are you?

00:17:44.220 --> 00:17:48.640
Who's deflecting my attack and protecting the Pharaoh?

00:17:48.640 --> 00:17:50.370
My name is Hasan.

00:17:50.370 --> 00:17:55.420
The guardian who's protected Egypt's Pharaohs throughout history.

00:17:56.350 --> 00:18:00.660
Pharaoh Aknamkanon has asked me to protect you.

00:18:00.660 --> 00:18:01.800
Hasan?

00:18:02.660 --> 00:18:04.620
I've seen you before!

00:18:05.540 --> 00:18:08.170
Who are you?

00:18:08.170 --> 00:18:09.870
My name is Hasan.

00:18:09.870 --> 00:18:10.990
Hasan?

00:18:10.990 --> 00:18:15.220
Pharaoh, the evil Zorc is attempting to revive.

00:18:15.220 --> 00:18:18.440
Only you can defeat Zorc.

00:18:18.440 --> 00:18:26.680
Hasan, if you’re Aknamkanon's servant, give my brother a message.

00:18:26.680 --> 00:18:32.420
Only Seto is worthy of ruling the Nile as the Pharaoh!

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:40.210
I won't listen to someone who sold his soul to fulfill his desires!

00:18:43.470 --> 00:18:44.880
What?

00:18:50.740 --> 00:18:52.880
The Hourglass of Frozen Time!

00:18:53.640 --> 00:18:59.410
Now my friends can move!

00:19:01.380 --> 00:19:02.910
I can move!

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:04.720
How can you move?

00:19:04.720 --> 00:19:08.670
Only the chosen ones can move!

00:19:08.670 --> 00:19:13.820
Great Shadow Magus, time has started to move again!

00:19:15.060 --> 00:19:17.680
Silence, Hasan!

00:19:17.680 --> 00:19:23.070
Not bad.  But it’s too early to feel safe, Yugi.

00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:27.070
Look at your pieces' gauges.

00:19:27.070 --> 00:19:29.770
What?  Gauges?

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:33.360
The glow on their Diadiankhs represent their soul gauges.

00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:39.080
My Great Shadow Magus's gauge is full, but your pieces...

00:19:45.100 --> 00:19:48.910
When the gauge drops to 0, that person is gone.

00:19:48.910 --> 00:19:52.920
When the Pharaoh is hurt in battle, and his Ba gauge empties...

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:54.920
...you'll also die.

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:58.530
Not just you, but your friends as well!

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:05.500
Everyone in this world has a Ba gauge.

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:12.100
But most don't have Diadiankhs, so they don’t know how much Ba they have left.

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:16.920
So they think tomorrow will always come.

00:20:16.920 --> 00:20:23.520
Ignorant fools.  They don’t realize that we choose whether they live or die.

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:25.280
Hey, Yugi.

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:31.040
Do you know how many died due to our battles so far?

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:33.530
Bakura!  How dare you!

00:20:33.530 --> 00:20:37.500
Don’t act all innocent.

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:40.430
You played a part in this too.

00:20:40.430 --> 00:20:43.540
You agreed to this battle.

00:20:43.540 --> 00:20:46.760
This is a game between gods.

00:20:46.760 --> 00:20:49.750
In this game, we are gods.

00:20:49.750 --> 00:20:55.590
The winner of this RPG will be the ultimate god!

00:20:58.760 --> 00:21:01.760
Bakura!  I’m not like you!

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:04.770
I don’t intend to be a god!

00:21:04.770 --> 00:21:08.500
For my friends...  And this world...

00:21:08.510 --> 00:21:11.520
I will protect them, no matter what!

00:21:11.520 --> 00:21:13.630
Say what you want, Yugi!

00:21:13.630 --> 00:21:18.860
I'll be the evil god who rules this world, bringing death and destruction!

00:21:18.860 --> 00:21:24.520
And I'll show you the end of existence!

00:21:27.920 --> 00:21:29.270
How dare you!

00:21:29.270 --> 00:21:31.270
It’s too late!

00:21:31.270 --> 00:21:36.280
The countdown to destruction has already begun!

00:22:02.080 --> 00:22:16.700
Right now, we don't need a map

00:22:16.860 --> 00:22:32.420
The miracle that tore through the darkness is in my hand

00:22:33.140 --> 00:22:38.260
Without a goal in mind

00:22:39.580 --> 00:22:46.830
We just step towards our dream

00:22:47.220 --> 00:22:52.470
EYE'S  As you sense it

00:22:52.660 --> 00:23:00.940
Your eye will find it

00:23:01.300 --> 00:23:06.750
Oh! EYE'S  What you wish for

00:23:07.540 --> 00:23:14.890
Will touch your soul

00:23:15.080 --> 00:23:18.150
In a duel

00:23:28.060 --> 00:23:33.380
The Pharaoh's world of lost memories is actually a game world.

00:23:33.380 --> 00:23:37.680
The priests and us are game pieces?

00:23:38.160 --> 00:23:41.380
The countdown to Zorc's resurrection has begun.

00:23:41.380 --> 00:23:46.370
Aknadin - now the Great Shadow Magus - tempts Seto into becoming the next Pharaoh.

00:23:46.370 --> 00:23:51.410
Bobasa, what's your role in this world?

00:23:52.450 --> 00:23:54.710
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Great Shadow Magus

00:23:54.710 --> 00:23:56.240
Stay tuned!
